<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Reed-Henderson Math Worksheets</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --teal-900:#0f4c4c;
    --teal-700:#146b6b;
    --teal-500:#1f8a8a;
    --teal-100:#d7ebe9;
    --cream:#f7f4ec;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --ink:#1c2b2b;
    --ink-soft:#4a5a5a;
    --answer-pink:#b0339e;
    --line:#d8d2c2;
    --radius:14px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.5;
    padding-bottom:60px;
  }
  h1,h2,.display{ font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; }
  .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}

  header.banner{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--teal-900),var(--teal-700));
    color:#fff;padding:44px 0 32px;
  }
  header.banner h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:30px;}
  header.banner p{margin:0;opacity:.9;font-size:14.5px;}

  .subject{
    background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px 26px;margin:26px 0;
    box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(15,76,76,0.05);
  }
  .subject h2{
    margin:0 0 4px;font-size:20px;color:var(--teal-900);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  }
  .subject .sub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px;margin:0 0 16px;}
  .links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
  a.lesson{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
    background:#fbfaf6;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    padding:13px 16px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);
    font-size:15px;font-weight:600;transition:background .15s ease,border-color .15s ease;
  }
  a.lesson:hover{background:var(--teal-100);border-color:var(--teal-500);}
  a.lesson .arrow{color:var(--teal-700);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;}
  a.lesson.fun{border-color:var(--answer-pink);background:#fdf1fb;}
  a.lesson.fun:hover{background:#fbe4f7;}
  a.lesson.fun .arrow{color:var(--answer-pink);}
  .divider{border:none;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);margin:14px 0;}
  .group-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0 0 8px;}

  footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:30px 0 10px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Reed-Henderson Math Worksheets</h1>
    <p>Pick your class below to open today's assignment. Each one saves a PDF of your work and sends your results to your teacher when you submit.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>📘 Algebra II — Module 1, Topic 1</h2>
    <p class="sub">Defining and transforming absolute value functions</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T1L1.html">Lesson 1 — Defining Absolute Value Functions <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T1L2.html">Lesson 2 — Transformations of Absolute Value Functions <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T1L3.html">Lesson 3 — Absolute Value Equations and Inequalities <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <hr class="divider">
    <p class="group-label">Topic 1 Review</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="PracticeTopic1.html">Skills Practice — Topic 1 <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="AssessmentTopic1.html">End-of-Topic Assessment <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>📘 Algebra II — Module 1, Topic 2</h2>
    <p class="sub">Solving systems of equations and optimization</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T2L1.html">Lesson 1 — Solving Systems of Equations <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T2L2.html">Lesson 2 — Optimization <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Algebra2_M1T2L3.html">Lesson 3 — Solving Systems with Matrices <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>📐 Geometry — Module 1, Topic 1</h2>
    <p class="sub">Foundations of points, lines, planes, and logical reasoning</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T1L1.html">Lesson 1 — Points, Lines, Planes, Rays, and Line Segments <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T1L2.html">Lesson 2 — Formal Reasoning in Euclidean Geometry <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T1L3.html">Lesson 3 — Making Conjectures and Deductive Reasoning <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>📐 Geometry — Module 1, Topic 2</h2>
    <p class="sub">Coordinate geometry: constructing the plane, parallel/perpendicular lines, and classifying quadrilaterals</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T2L1.html">Lesson 1 — Constructing a Coordinate Plane <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T2L2.html">Lesson 2 — Parallel and Perpendicular Lines <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson" href="Geometry_M1T2L3.html">Lesson 3 — Classifying Quadrilaterals on the Coordinate Plane <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>🎯 TSIA2 Math Practice</h2>
    <p class="sub">10 randomly-drawn practice questions across all four TSIA2 math domains</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson" href="TSIA2_Math_Practice.html">Start Practice Test <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="subject">
    <h2>🎉 Fun Friday Trivia</h2>
    <p class="sub">A no-pressure, just-for-fun round — music, memes, sports, and random knowledge</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a class="lesson fun" href="FriAlgebra2.html">Fun Friday — Algebra II <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="lesson fun" href="FriGeometry.html">Fun Friday — Geometry <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<footer>Reed-Henderson Math Worksheets</footer>

</body>
</html>
